  Caption says the elderly woman was taken by 108 ambulance to Tiruchengode government hospital and then Namakkal hospital; the article says the 108 ambulance took her to Tiruchengode, but the caption's wording ("பின்னர் 108 ஆம்புலன்ஸ் மூலம் திருச்செங்கோடு அரசு மருத்துவமனைக்கும்") is placed before the daughter's arrival, which misorders events.
  Caption and reel_script describe the daughter Parameswari as arriving from Coimbatore, but the caption's sentence structure is garbled: it says she was 'taken' with the ambulance while the article says the daughter took her, creating an unclear sequence.
  reel_script says the woman was taken to Tiruchengode hospital 'after' the fall, but the caption says she was first taken to Tiruchengode and then Namakkal; the article says she was admitted to Namakkal Government Medical College Hospital for higher treatment, which is consistent, but the slide text 'வெள்ளிக்கிழமை மாலை உயிரிழந்தார்' is placed while the 'மேல் சிகிச்சைக்காக' line is cut off mid-sentence in slides_spec, making the slide text meaningless.
  slides_spec line 'கந்தம்பாளையம் அருந்ததியர் காலனியைச் சேர்ந்த' is an incomplete sentence with no clear meaning, and 'கிருஷ்ணவேணி, அப்பகுதியினரின் உதவியுடன் அருக்காணியை மீட்டு' and similar lines are truncated fragments.
  The caption's age '46 வயது' for the daughter is stated correctly from the article, but the caption mixes the daughter's residence with the family section without clear grammar.
